XCOMM
XCOMM comcomp examples -- ComTerp funcs comcomp has been proven to
XCOMM compile. The .go output is generated here via comcomp itself, not
XCOMM checked in -- comcomp (and comterp_run) must already be installed
XCOMM on PATH first (make install in src/comcomp). "generate" is
XCOMM deliberately its own target, not hooked to "all", since comcomp
XCOMM isn't necessarily on PATH yet during a plain top-level build:
XCOMM make generate here once comcomp is installed.
XCOMM

PACKAGE = comcomp_examples

GENERATED = isort.go double.go

generate:: $(GENERATED)

isort.go: isort.comt
	comcomp isort.comt isort isort.go

double.go: double.comt
	comcomp double.comt double.go

clean::
	$(RM) $(GENERATED)
